PLACEHOLDER-NOT-A-REAL-TFLITE-MODEL
See README.md in this directory: the real, MD5-verified genus_classifier.tflite (EfficientNet-B0,
float16, 8.24 MB, ADR-002) lives outside the repository at
~/Projects/cortege-ml-artifacts/genus-classifier-iteration4/ and was not reachable from the
container this file was produced in. This file exists only so Metro can bundle a `.tflite` asset at
this path; react-native-fast-tflite will fail to parse it as a model at runtime, which is the
intended, tested "model load failed" path (ADR-002 D-08): the app shows a clear message and falls
back to manual genus entry. Replace this file (and genus_classifier_manifest.json, whose "labels"
order must match the real model's output tensor) with the real artifacts before release.
